<title>UK: NatWest prices 972 million stg asset-backed deal.</title>
<headline>NatWest prices 972 million stg asset-backed deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 972 million stg multi-tranche asset-backed issue launched in the name Finance for Residential Social Housing Plc (FRESH) has been priced, lead manager Greenwich NatWest said on Monday.</p>
<p>The notes are backed by Housing Association loans originated by the Housing Corporation and Housing for Wales (Tai Cymru).</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p>SERIES 1 ASSET BACKED PREMIUM NOTES DUE OCTOBER 2058</p>
<p> CLASS	1-A1	  1-A2	  1-A3	  1-B</p>
<p> AMOUNT     727,883,549 115,905,023 37,089,607  37,089,607</p>
<p> COUPON     11.126	11.126	11.126	11.126</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  127.039     120.204     124.62	122.136</p>
<p> SPREAD     60 BP	 80 BP	 80 BP	 100 BP</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	   AAA	   AAA	   BBB*</p>
<p> AVG LIFE   28.6 YRS    19.5 YRS    28.6 YRS    28.7 YRS</p>
<p> NOTES     *ALSO BAA3 MOODYS.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
